  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Point of intersection of curve and a line is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fb056749-aed9-4d50-b0ca-7e3c962209ac-9887686.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 259px;\" /></p><p>Required area</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>64</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>112</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></math></p>",
